==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|fr|taximètre}}, from {{der|en|de|Taxameter}}, coined from {{der|en|ML.|taxa||tax, charge}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*tag-||to touch, handle}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[device]] installed in a [[taxicab]] that [[calculate]]s the [[fare]] based upon [[distance]] [[travelled]] and [[waiting]] [[time]].

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|taxi}}

